OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced after NI's biggest
OL,4,Acocaine seizure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 41-year-old man has received a
OL,7,Fsix-year sentence for his role in what
OL,8,Fpolice said was the largest ever
OL,9,Fseizure of cocaine in Northern Ireland.
OL,11,FCiaran McBride, of Listrakelt Road,
OL,12,FDerrynoose, was arrested in December
OL,13,F2023 after officers found cocaine with
OL,14,Fan estimated street value of #12m in
OL,15,FJonesborough, County Armagh.
OL,17,FThe drugs were discovered under a false
OL,18,Ffloor in a frozen meat truck.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
